WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:02.919
What is it?

00:00:03.628 --> 00:00:04.713
Look over there!

00:00:09.926 --> 00:00:13.013
There really is a piano...

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:16.224
Of course! This is
the piano in the forest.

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:25.859
It's a piano!

00:00:29.446 --> 00:00:31.698
I can't believe it!

00:00:31.781 --> 00:00:35.410
With the light pouring through,
it looks like the forest is a stage!

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:38.121
It's even prettier at night.

00:00:39.998 --> 00:00:42.917
Okay. You're my witness, okay?

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.044
You got it.

00:00:57.265 --> 00:00:59.434
-It's broken.
-What?

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.228
No way. It makes sound.

00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:03.480
But...

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:04.606
See?

00:01:04.689 --> 00:01:07.859
-Try pressing the keys harder!
-There's no sound.

00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:08.777
Let me try.

00:01:09.319 --> 00:01:13.281
Just watch.&nbsp;It's never not made a sound!

00:01:17.952 --> 00:01:18.828
See?

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:21.873
-Told ya.
-No way!

00:01:25.043 --> 00:01:25.960
How?

00:01:28.379 --> 00:01:31.049
Well, this is my piano after all.

00:01:31.216 --> 00:01:33.968
I bet it only opens its heart for me.

00:01:35.553 --> 00:01:36.805
Let me try again!

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:45.522
It's no use.

00:01:45.688 --> 00:01:47.816
If I try any harder, I'll hurt my fingers.

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:49.567
All right, step aside.

00:02:01.579 --> 00:02:04.999
That's the arrangement that
Mr. Ajino played yesterday.

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:29.232
Kai is amazing!

00:02:29.899 --> 00:02:31.401
But... how?

